  <div><media><image alt="Graph of inequality. " src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/c73c4f6e9e8e1f53af572c5024d6a7ea4b07ba1a"/></media></div>
</solution></exercise>
</example><!--Q4-->
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="4" type="enumerated">
  <item> Use the graphing tool or technology outside the course. Graph the inequality \( \text-x + 8 \leq y \) using the Desmos tool below. </item>
</list>
<div class="os-raise-ib-desmos-gc" data-schema-version="1.0"/>
<example><exercise>
