  <div><media><image alt="Graph of inequality. " src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/492d873af5799b4b9d3fc92df8daf6ec6176929c"/></media></div>
</solution></exercise>
</example><!--Q5-->
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="5" type="enumerated">
  <item>Use the graphing tool or technology outside the course. Graph the inequality \( y &lt; 10x - 200 \) using the Desmos tool below. </item>
