</solution></exercise>
</example><!--Q6-->
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="6" type="enumerated">
  <item>Use the graphing tool or technology outside the course. Graph the inequality \( 2x + 3y &gt; 60 \) using the Desmos tool below. </item>
